{"articleNo":"1212","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1212&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년 8월말 퇴직교원 정부포상 추천대상자 명단 공개","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.05.07","hit":"10082","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #0099cc 5.7pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #0099cc 5.7pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"469\" height=\"91\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 22pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 태 나무,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; COLOR: #0033cc; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 태 나무,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;2010년 8월말 퇴직교원&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; COLOR: #0033cc; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 태 나무,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">정부포상 추천대상자 명단 공개</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<br>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">2010년도 8월말 퇴직교원 정부포상 추천대상자 명단을 다음과 같이 공개합니다.</font></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">1. 공개기간 : 2010.05.07.(금)~2010.05.17.(월)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">2. 공개목적 : 포상 추천 대상자에 대한 포상 적격성 검증<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">3. 주요공적 : 투철한 사명감과 책임감으로 교육과 학문증진 및 사회 봉사<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 에 헌신하는 등 교육 발전에 지대한 공이 있음<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">4. 포상 추천 대상자 명단</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"153\" bgcolor=\"#8fc5c5\" height=\"55\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">소속</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"135\" bgcolor=\"#8fc5c5\" height=\"55\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">직급</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000